[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\uFF5E\uFF01\n\u5642\u306B\u306F\u805E\u3044\u3066\u305F\u3051\u3069\u3001\u672C\u5F53\u306B\u4F3C\u5408\u3063\u3066\u308B\u306D\u3047\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So cute~! I\u0027d heard rumors, but it really does suit you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C6\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tess"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306B\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC\u306E\u6559\u3048\u5B50\u306A\u3093\u3067\u3057\u3087\uFF1F\u3000\u3053\u3093\u306A\u306B\n\u304B\u308F\u3044\u304F\u3066\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u306E\u8155\u3082\u7ACB\u3064\u3063\u3066\u3059\u3054\u3044\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And you\u0027re Sophie\u0027s apprentice too? That\u0027s amazing, being this cute and talented at alchemy!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E2\u30CB\u30AB",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Monika"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3063\u3001\u305D\u3046\u306A\u306E\uFF01\uFF1F\n\u3058\u3083\u3042\u5929\u624D\u5C11\u5973\u306A\u3093\u3060\u306D\u3047\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What, really!? Then you must be some kind of prodigy!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C6\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tess"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u305D\u3046\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\uFF01\u3000\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306E\n\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3055\u306F\u6B62\u307E\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3092\u77E5\u3089\u306A\u3044\u308F\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s right, that\u0027s right! Firis\u0027s cuteness knows no bounds!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30A2\u30FC\u30CD",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Riane"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3068\u3001\u3068\u3053\u308D\u3067\uFF01\n\u4E8C\u4EBA\u306F\u516C\u8A8D\u8A66\u9A13\u5E0C\u671B\u306E\u65B9\u306A\u306E\u304B\u3057\u3089\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "B-by the way! Are you two hoping to take the licensing exam!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3088\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3089\u3053\u306E\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u304C\n\u63A8\u85A6\u72B6\u3092\u66F8\u3044\u3066\u3042\u3052\u3066\u3082\u3044\u3044\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If you\u0027d like, I could write you a letter of recommendation..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3084\u3044\u3084\u3044\u3084\uFF01\n\u3042\u305F\u3057\u3089\u306F\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306E\u8863\u88C5\u3092\u898B\u306B\u6765\u305F\u3060\u3051\u3060\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, no, no! We just came to see Firis\u0027s outfit!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C6\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tess"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u306A\u306E\u3001\u3054\u3081\u3093\u306A\u3055\u3044\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s right, I\u0027m sorry."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E2\u30CB\u30AB",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Monika"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u3088\u308A\u3055\uFF5E\u3001\u3053\u306E\u304B\u308F\u3044\u3044\u8863\u88C5\u3063\u3066\n\u8B72\u3063\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3048\u305F\u308A\u3057\u306A\u3044\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, speaking of which~ Any chance we could get one of these cute outfits?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C6\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tess"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3063\u3001\u79C1\u3082\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u6C17\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305F\u306E\u3088\u306D\u3002\n\u81EA\u5206\u3067\u7740\u308B\u7528\u3058\u3083\u306A\u304F\u3066\u3082\u8863\u88C5\u306E\u51FA\u6765\u304C\u3044\u3044\u304B\u3089\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, I was actually curious about that too. Even if not to wear, the craftsmanship is quite impressive..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E2\u30CB\u30AB",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Monika"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u3063\u3001\u30C0\u30E1\u30C0\u30E1\u30C3\uFF01\n\u3053\u308C\u3092\u7740\u3089\u308C\u308B\u306E\u306F\u516C\u8A8D\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u3060\u3051\u306A\u3093\u3060\u304B\u3089\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "N-no way! These outfits are only for licensed alchemists!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6B32\u3057\u304B\u3063\u305F\u3089\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u8A66\u9A13\u306B\u53D7\u304B\u3063\u3066\u3001\n\u7ACB\u6D3E\u306A\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3066\u304B\u3089\u53D7\u3051\u53D6\u3063\u3066\u3061\u3087\u3046\u3060\u3044\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If you want one, you\u0027ll have to pass the exam and become a proper alchemist first!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u30A4\u30EB\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306E\u3053\u306E\u8863\u88C5\u3001\n\u307F\u3093\u306A\u6B32\u3057\u304C\u3063\u3066\u308B\u3088\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But Ilmeria, everyone really wants your outfits, don\u0027t they?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E2\u30CB\u30AB\u305F\u3061\u3068\u540C\u3058\u3088\u3046\u306B\u3001\u8A66\u9A13\u514D\u9664\u3067\u8863\u88C5\u3060\u3051\n\u3082\u3089\u3048\u306A\u3044\u304B\u3068\u3044\u3046\u58F0\u306E\u307B\u3046\u304C\u591A\u3044\u6C17\u3082\u3057\u307E\u3059\u304C",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I think most people, like Monika and Tess, are actually asking if they can get the outfit without taking the exam."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D7\u30E9\u30D5\u30BF",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3063\u2026\u2026\u78BA\u304B\u306B\u305D\u306E\u554F\u3044\u5408\u308F\u305B\u306F\u591A\u3044\u308F\u2026\u2026\u3002\n\u3068\u3044\u3046\u304B\u6BCE\u65E5\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh... you\u0027re right, we do get a lot of those requests... Every day, actually..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307F\u3093\u306A\u8863\u88C5\u3060\u3051\u6B32\u3057\u304C\u3063\u3066\u3001\n\u809D\u5FC3\u306E\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u306B\u306A\u308B\u3063\u3066\u4EBA\u306F\u307B\u3068\u3093\u3069\u3044\u306A\u3044\u306E\u3088\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone just wants the outfit, hardly anyone wants to become an actual alchemist..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30C3\u3001\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u2026\u2026\uFF01\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-Ilmeria...!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B3\u30EB\u30CD\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Corneria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u308F\u3063\u3001\u30B3\u30EB\u3061\u3083\u3093\uFF01\uFF1F\n\u3069\u3046\u3057\u305F\u306E\u305D\u3093\u306A\u306B\u614C\u3066\u3066\u6765\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wah, Corneria!? Why are you in such a hurry?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3069\u3001\u3069\u3046\u3057\u305F\u306E\u3088\u30B3\u30EB\u30CD\u30EA\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u3002\n\u3042\uFF01\u3000\u3082\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3066\u5927\u91CF\u767A\u6CE8\u3057\u3066\u304A\u3044\u305F\u8863\u88C5\u304C\u3064\u3044\u306B\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "W-what\u0027s wrong, Corneria? Oh! Could it be that the bulk order of outfits finally..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u76D7\u307E\u308C\u3066\u3057\u307E\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They\u0027ve been stolen...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B3\u30EB\u30CD\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Corneria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3048\u3063\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8863\u88C5\u304C\u307E\u308B\u3054\u3068\u2026\u2026\u3002\n\u5168\u90E8\u76D7\u307E\u308C\u3066\u3057\u307E\u3063\u305F\u3067\u3059\u2026\u2026\uFF01\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "All the outfits... Every single one was stolen...!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B3\u30EB\u30CD\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Corneria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3047\uFF5E\u3063\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whaaaat!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u306A\uFF5E\u308B\u307B\u3069\u3002\n\u4ED5\u4E0A\u3052\u305F\u8863\u88C5\u3092\u904B\u642C\u4E2D\u306B\u72D9\u308F\u308C\u3066\u8377\u8ECA\u3054\u3068\u2026\u2026\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I see. So they targeted the cart during transport..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30CF\u30A4\u30C7\u30A3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u304B\u2026\u2026\u3002\n\u968F\u5206\u3068\u6065\u77E5\u3089\u305A\u2026\u2026\u3001\u547D\u77E5\u3089\u305A\u306A\u5974\u3089\u306E\u3088\u3046\u3060\u306A\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see... Quite shameless... and reckless of them..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3063\u305F\u304F\u3060\u308F\uFF01\n\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u305F\u3061\u306B\u76D7\u307F\u3092\u50CD\u304F\u306A\u3093\u3066\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Absolutely! To dare steal from us...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7D76\u5BFE\u8A31\u3055\u306A\u3044\u3093\u3060\u304B\u3089\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027ll never forgive them!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3060\u306A\u3002\u4E00\u523B\u3082\u65E9\u304F\u72AF\u4EBA\u3092\u6355\u307E\u3048\u3066\u3001\n\u81EA\u8EAB\u306E\u611A\u304B\u3055\u3068\u7F6A\u306E\u91CD\u3055\u3092\u5473\u308F\u308F\u305B\u3066\u3084\u3089\u306A\u3044\u3068\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. We must catch the culprits quickly and make them face the gravity of their crime..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u305F\u3061\u306E\u6C17\u304C\u53CE\u307E\u3093\u306A\u3044\u3063\u3066\u3044\u3046\u304B\u2026\u2026\uFF01\n\u3082\u3046\u4ECA\u3059\u3050\u306B\u3067\u3082\u30DC\u30B3\u30DC\u30B3\u306B\u3057\u3066\u3084\u308A\u305F\u3044\u6C17\u5206\u3060\u3088\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We\u0027re not just going to let this slide...! I want to teach them a lesson right now!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30CF\u30A4\u30C7\u30A3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3058\u3083\u3042\u4ECA\u304B\u3089\u3067\u3082\u635C\u7D22\u3092\u958B\u59CB\u3057\u307E\u3057\u3087\u3046\uFF01\n\u305B\u3063\u304B\u304F\u9811\u5F35\u3063\u3066\u4F5C\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305F\u3060\u3044\u305F\u3082\u306E\u3067\u3059\u3057\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then let\u0027s start searching right away! After all the hard work put into making them...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u306D\u3001\u307E\u305A\u306F\u2500\u2500",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, first we should--"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u5F85\u3063\u3066\uFF1F\u3000\u3053\u308C\u3063\u3066\u3082\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3066\u597D\u6A5F\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\uFF1F\n\u3000\u76D7\u307E\u308C\u305F\u8863\u88C5\u3092\u53D6\u308A\u623B\u3057\u305F\u3063\u3066\u529F\u7E3E\u304C\u3042\u308C\u3070\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Wait? Could this actually be an opportunity? If we recover the stolen outfits...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u307F\u3093\u306A\u304B\u3089\u3084\u3063\u3071\u308A\u5929\u624D\u306F\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u3060\u3063\u3066\n\u3000\u601D\u3063\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3048\u308B\u3063\u3066\u3053\u3068\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\uFF1F\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Everyone will finally recognize my genius, won\u0027t they?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u3061\u3083\u3093\uFF1F\u3000\u307E\u305A\u306F\u3069\u3046\u3059\u308B\u306E\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria? What should we do first?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3063\uFF1F\u3000\u3042\u3063\u3001\u3048\uFF5E\u3063\u3068\u2026\u2026\u3002\n\u30E6\u3001\u30E6\u30CA\u3055\u3093\u3002\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306B\u983C\u307F\u304C\u3042\u308B\u306E\u3060\u3051\u3069\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? Oh, um... J-Juna. I have a favor to ask..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u3093\u3060\u3001\u306A\u3093\u3067\u3082\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u304F\u308C",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What is it? Ask me anything."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3044\u3084\u3041\u3001\u3044\u304D\u306A\u308A\u5927\u635C\u67FB\u7DB2\u306E\u304A\u9858\u3044\u3092\u3055\u308C\u308B\u306A\u3093\u3066\n\u30E6\u30CA\u3082\u76F8\u5F53\u3053\u306E\u4EF6\u306B\u80A9\u5165\u308C\u3057\u3066\u308B\u3093\u3060\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My, my, requesting a full-scale investigation right away... Juna must be taking this quite seriously."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30DE\u30F3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3061\u308D\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3002\u7A83\u76D7\u306F\u91CD\u7F6A\u3067\u3059\u304B\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course. Theft is a serious crime."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3044\u3001\u3044\u3064\u3082\u3088\u308A\u672C\u6C17\u306E\u9854\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3066\u308B\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(She looks even more serious than usual...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30DE\u30F3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u72AF\u4EBA\u306F\u307E\u3060\u898B\u3064\u304B\u3063\u3066\u306A\u3044\u3093\u3067\u3059\u3088\u306D\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But you haven\u0027t found the culprits yet, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30A2\u30FC\u30CD",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Riane"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6B8B\u5FF5\u306A\u304C\u3089\u3001\u624B\u639B\u304B\u308A\u3082\u63B4\u3081\u3066\u3044\u306A\u3044\u3093\u3060\u3002\n\u76D7\u54C1\u306A\u3089\u305D\u308C\u3092\u58F2\u308A\u3055\u3070\u304F\u306E\u304C\u9244\u5247\u306A\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Unfortunately, we haven\u0027t found any leads. Usually, stolen goods are sold off right away..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30DE\u30F3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8CA9\u58F2\u7D4C\u8DEF\u3092\u7D5E\u3063\u3066\u5075\u5BDF\u3092\u3057\u3066\u3082\u898B\u3064\u304B\u3089\u306A\u3044\u3093\u3060",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But we\u0027ve checked all the usual channels and found nothing."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30ED\u30DE\u30F3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\uFF5E\u3093\u2026\u2026\u3002\u3044\u3063\u305F\u3044\u4F55\u304C\u76EE\u7684\u306A\u3093\u3060\u308D\u3046\uFF1F\n\u304A\u91D1\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u306E\u304B\u306A\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm... I wonder what their goal is? Maybe it\u0027s not about money?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3066\u76D7\u8CCA\u3068\u304B\u3058\u3083\u306A\u304F\u3066\u53CE\u96C6\u5BB6\u3001\u3068\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Could it be a collector rather than thieves?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u3068\u3057\u3066\u3082\u3053\u3093\u306A\u3084\u308A\u65B9\u3057\u3061\u3083\u30C0\u30E1\u3060\u3063\u3066\u306E\uFF01\n\u6355\u307E\u3048\u305F\u3089\u3001\u3068\u3063\u3061\u3081\u3066\u3084\u308B\u3093\u3060\u304B\u3089\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even so, this is unforgivable! When we catch them, they\u0027re going to pay!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30CF\u30A4\u30C7\u30A3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306B\u3057\u3066\u3082\u672C\u5F53\u306B\u5909\u3060\u308F\u2026\u2026\u3002\n\u58F2\u308A\u3082\u305B\u305A\u3001\u8AB0\u304B\u306B\u8B72\u3063\u305F\u308A\u3082\u3057\u306A\u3044\u306A\u3093\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It really is strange though... Not selling them or giving them away..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E2\u30CB\u30AB",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Monika"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3053\u3046\u306A\u3063\u305F\u3089\uFF11\u3064\u3001\u829D\u5C45\u3092\u6253\u3063\u3066\u3084\u308D\u3046\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...In that case, let\u0027s set up a little trap."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u829D\u5C45\u3063\u3066\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A trap?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30D5\u30A3\u30EA\u30B9",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3075\u3075\u2026\u2026\u305D\u308C\u306F\u306D\u3047\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehehe... Well..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30EB\u30E1\u30EA\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u738B\u90FD\u306E\u55AB\u8336\u5E97\u3067\u50CD\u304F\u7570\u90A6\u4EBA\u306E\u5973\u6027\u3002\n\u5E83\u5834\u306B\u3042\u308B\u30AB\u30D5\u30A7\u300C\u661F\u306E\u7E6D\u300D\u3092\u30E9\u30A4\u30D0\u30EB\u8996\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A foreign woman who works at a caf\u00E9 in the capital. She sees the plaza caf\u00E9 \u0027Star Cocoon\u0027 as her rival."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30C6\u30B9\u30FB\u30CF\u30A4\u30C4\u30DE\u30F3",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tess"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30BD\u30D5\u30A3\u30FC\u306E\u5E7C\u99B4\u67D3\u3067\u3042\u308A\u89AA\u53CB\u3002\n\u81EA\u5206\u306E\u3084\u308A\u305F\u3044\u3053\u3068\u3092\u3084\u308D\u3046\u3068\u4E16\u754C\u3092\u65C5\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie\u0027s childhood friend. She travels the world pursuing her dreams."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E2\u30CB\u30AB\u30FB\u30A8\u30EB\u30E1\u30F3\u30E9\u30A4\u30D2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Monika"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]